\par\par {\*\bkmkstart toc3}{\*\bkmkend toc3}\b \uc2  Japan to agree on  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  swap deal with China soon. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Yoko Nishikawa \par \uc2 538 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 Oktober 2001\par 10:19\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO, Oct 23 (Reuters) - Japan and China are in the final stage of talks on a yen-yuan swap deal as part of a fledgling Asia-wide \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  safety net, Japanese officials said on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  They hope to agree on the scheme in the next few weeks. \par \par \uc2  The bilateral swap deal would be the fifth such pact signed by Japan as part of an ambitious plan, known as the Chiang Mai Initiative, for a regional web of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps designed to ward off financial crises like the one in 1997 that plunged much of the region into recession. \par \par \uc2  "We are in the final stage of the talks," a Bank of Japan (BOJ) official, who is close to the negotiations, told Reuters. \par \par \uc2  He said some technical legal issues needed to be finalised but both sides had agreed on the basic framework. \par \par \uc2  The swap line will be for around $3 billion, the size of similar deals that Japan has signed with Thailand and the Philippines, several Japanese officials said. \par \par \uc2  MOSTLY SYMBOLIC \par \par \uc2  Japan has already signed a $2 billion swap deal with South Korea and a $1 billion scheme with Malaysia under the Chiang Mai Initiative (CMI), named for the northern Thai resort where it was agreed by finance ministers from 13 Asian countries last year. \par \par \uc2  China is also talking to South Korea and Thailand about setting up swap lines. \par \par \uc2  Unlike Japan's other swaps under the CMI, the China scheme will be denominated in yen, not dollars. \par \par \uc2  China opted for a yen-yuan pact because it already has plenty of dollars in its foreign reserves, according to Japanese finance ministry officials. \par \par \uc2  At present, Japan has only one yen-denominated \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swap line, with the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . That facility is designed mainly for \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  purposes and was tapped in September 2000 when the ECB and the BOJ \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prop up the euro. \par \par \uc2  The Japan-\b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2  swap pact is primarily symbolic as neither Japan nor China is expected to experience liquidity or balance-of-payment problems in the foreseeable future. \par \par \uc2  Japan has the largest foreign reserves in the world, totalling $397 billion, while China's reserves reached $190 billion at the end of August. \par \par \uc2  Moreover, the yuan is not convertible on the capital account, vastly reducing China's vulnerability to the sort of speculative attack for which the CMI is designed. \par \par \uc2  However, Japanese officials have put particular weight on China's backing for the regional swap network, which marks a turnaround from its hostility to a Japanese plan, launched at the height of the 1997 financial crisis, for an Asian Monetary Fund. \par \par \uc2  Japan and China started holding talks on the swap line early this year. The talks have progressed smoothly despite a row over Japanese curbs on Chinese farm products and anger in Beijing after Prime Minister Junichiro Koizumi paid homage to a Tokyo shrine where some convicted World War Two war criminals are honoured along with Japan's war dead. \par \par \uc2  China's State Council will need to approve the swap scheme before the People's Bank of China, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , strikes the deal. The BOJ's board will also need to give its endorsement. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011023dxan00fm8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
