\par\par {\*\bkmkstart toc4}{\*\bkmkend toc4}\b  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2 's Dai reaffirms stable yuan policy. \b0\par\par\uc2 222 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 September 2001\par 02:49\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  NANJING, China, Sept 19 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Dai Xianglong said on Wednesday China's remained committed to the stability of its yuan \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and said entry to the WTO would bring external shocks. \par \par \uc2  "The objective of China's monetary policy is to maintain the stability of the value of the RMB (yuan), thereby promoting economic growth," Dai said in a prepared speech to a business conference in Nanjing. "Changes in trade and investment flows associated with China's WTO entry are likely to give rise to larger balance of payments fluctuations and stronger external shocks," Dai said. \par \par \uc2  "While maintaining the same exchange rate regime, we will improve the exchange rate formation mechanism provided that the relative stability of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is not threatened," he said. \par \par \uc2  Officials say the government is planning to widen the trading band for the tightly held yuan \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  gradually, but have given no timetable. \par \par \uc2  Since April 2000, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has allowed the yuan to close marginally outside the tight 8.2770 to 8.2800 trading band it reinforced through \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  during the Asian economic crisis. \par \par \uc2  Dai also said \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2 's gross domestic product was expected to grow at an annual rate of seven percent during the 10th five year plan period, which runs through the end of 2005. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010919dx9j000sg\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
