\par\par {\*\bkmkstart toc30}{\*\bkmkend toc30}\b \uc2  China's Yuan Ends Flat In Lackluster Session \b0\par\par\uc2 229 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Mai 2001\par 06:22\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.\par \par \uc2  SHANGHAI -(Dow Jones)-  China's yuan closed unchanged at 8.2769 to the U.S. dolllar Tuesday after a lackluster session, traders said. \par \par \uc2  The yuan can only be converted to cover import and export requirements. Most exporters are required to sell 85% of their export receipts to state-owned banks. \par \par \uc2  The highly regulated market ignored the stable foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook forecast by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  published on the front page of one of the major business dailies. \par \par \uc2  "There's nothing new (in the report)," a trader at Shanghai Pudong Development Bank said. "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has said this many times before." \par \par \uc2  The yuan fluctuated between CNY8.2765 and CNY8.2772, and traders said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  didn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market. \par \par \uc2  Although \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2  is generally thought to maintain an unofficial yuan trading band between CNY8.2770 and CNY8.2800 to the dollar, the frequent breach of this range in recent sessions has led to speculation that China's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is trying out a wider band ahead of the country's entry into the World Trade Organization, expected later this year. \par \par \uc2  The yen dropped to CNY6.7078 per 100 yen from CNY6.7502. The Hong Kong dollar slipped to CNY1.0605 from CNY1.0610. \par \par \uc2  -By China Bureau, Dow Jones Newswires; (86-21) 6218-3268; djnews.shanghai@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  1153 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010711dx5f026m5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
