\par\par {\*\bkmkstart toc58}{\*\bkmkend toc58}\b \uc2  China's yuan ends flat amid slowing foreign trade. \b0\par\par\uc2 546 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2001\par 07:10\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SHANGHAI, March 13 (Reuters) - China's yuan closed unchanged against the U.S. dollar in thin trade on Tuesday after Foreign Trade Minister Shi Guangsheng said foreign trade growth was likely to slow this year. \par \par \uc2  The yuan ended at an intraday high of 8.2780, after moving in a narrow range for the entire session and touching a low of 8.2785. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said more players were adopting a wait-and-see attitude after Shi said China's foreign trade growth was likely to slow this year due to a weaker global economy. \par \par \uc2  "The growth rate of China's foreign trade in this year is likely to slow down due to slowing global economic growth and the high base of the rapid growth of China's foreign trade in the past two years," Shi said in a statement. \par \par \uc2  His remarks were backed by official trade figures issued on Monday that showed China's trade surplus plunging a year-on-year 17.85 percent to $2.37 billion in the first two months of this year, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "Local banks seemed to have become more reluctant to sell dollars as foreign trade was slowing and the trade surplus was narrowing, capping dollar inflow," said a dealer at a U.S. bank. \par \par \uc2  Turnover was slim at only $90 million, although that was up from Monday's $70 million, according {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.chinamoney.com.cn/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.chinamoney.com.cn}}}\uc2 , the website of the Shanghai-based \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  China's yuan is convertible only on the current account. Banks typically settle \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  positions against the yuan on the national market after trading hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  with corporate clients, mostly importers and exporters. \par \par \uc2  The yuan has generally stayed around the strong end of its normal wafer-thin trading band of 8.2770 and 8.2800 since the start of last year due to China's healthy trade surplus, which has ensured a steady inflow of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Exports rose 14.50 percent year-on-year in the January-February period while imports gained 17.70 percent. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the yuan was likely to move narrowly around the present levels in thin trade over the next few days. \par \par \uc2  They said there was no sign of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the central People's Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2  to push up or depress the yuan on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has sandwiched the yuan in the tiny band through \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  for about three years, partly to quell speculation of a devaluation. \par \par \uc2  But the bank has reduced its activity since last year, allowing the yuan to close outside the usual range more than 40 times since April 2000, although only twice outside the weak end. \par \par \uc2  Analysts say Beijing is moving towards a more flexible \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  regime to cushion China from trade shocks after its entry to the World Trade Organisation, probably this year. \par \par \uc2  But they say the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  seems more willing to test a wider trading range when the yuan breaches the strong end of the band and tends to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  more readily when it exceeds the weak end. \par \par \uc2  On Tuesday, the yuan weakened slightly to close at 6.8839 against 100 Japanese yen from 6.8660 on Monday. It ended unchanged at 1.0610 against the Hong Kong dollar. \par \par \uc2  . \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010713dx3d049ez\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
