\par\par {\*\bkmkstart toc68}{\*\bkmkend toc68}\b \uc2  China's yuan ends up, unaffected by Fed rate cut. \b0\par\par\uc2 544 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 Februar 2001\par 05:52\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SHANGHAI, Feb 1 (Reuters) - China's yuan firmed against the U.S. dollar on Thursday, supported by a strong dollar supply on the domestic \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market but unmoved by a rate cut by the U.S. Federal Reserve, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The yuan closed at 8.2774 to the dollar, compared with 8.2786 on Wednesday. It moved in a range of 8.2765 to 8.2775. \par \par \uc2  "The yuan has regained its strength after the Lunar New Year holiday because there is a continued oversupply of dollars on the market," said a local bank dealer. \par \par \uc2  The market reopened on Wednesday after being closed from January 24-30 for the long Chinese New Year holiday. \par \par \uc2  The yuan has recovered after closing at a weak 8.2810 on January 23 in thin trade ahead of the holiday - outside the weak end of the yuan's normal thin trading band of 8.2770 to 8.2800. \par \par \uc2  The central People's Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 China intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  periodically to keep the yuan within that razor-thin band for about three years after the Asian economic crisis, partly to quell speculation of a devaluation of the domestic \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Dealers said China's tight hold on its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  regime made the yuan largely immune from major policy moves abroad, including the U.S. rate cut. \par \par \uc2  "The Fed rate cut had no impact on trading today as the yuan is rarely affected by outside changes due to China's exchange rate controls," said a dealer at a U.S. bank. \par \par \uc2  On Wednesday, the Fed cut the federal funds rate on overnight bank lending by 50 basis points to 5.50 percent and cut the more symbolic discount rate to 5.0 percent from 5.50 percent. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said there was no sign of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the Shanghai-based \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  The bank has relaxed its control over the yuan's movements since last year, allowing the domestic \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to close outside its normal trading band more than 30 times since April 2000, most of them outside the strong end of the range. \par \par \uc2  Officials have said the government is considering a more flexible \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  regime to cushion the impact from trade shocks related to China's entry into the World Trade Organisation, probably this year. \par \par \uc2  But officials have not given a timetable for the shift. \par \par \uc2  A Reuters poll in December showed most \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  experts believed the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would allow the yuan to flow in a range of five percent up or down by the end of 2001, compared with a fraction of less than one percent at present. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the yuan was likely to rise slightly in the near term to move around the 8.2770 level because China's strong foreign trade surplus had produced ample dollar supply. \par \par \uc2  The yuan is convertible only on the current account and banks usually settle \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  positions on the national market after trading yuan with corporate clients, mostly exporters and importers. \par \par \uc2  Against other \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the yuan weakened to close Thursday at 7.1100 against the Japanese yen from Wednesday's 7.0325. \par \par \uc2  It closed little changed at 1.0605 against the Hong Kong dollar from 1.0606. \par \par \uc2  . \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010713dx2107ea4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
