the firm end of its normal band 23 times. \par \par \uc2  Analysts say Beijing is testing the waters for a more flexible \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  regime to offset the potential impact on its trade performance expected from membership in the World Trade Organisation. China expects to join the WTO in the next few months. \par \par \uc2  On Friday, the yuan firmed against the yen to end at 7.3550 versus Thursday's 7.3947. It closed flat at 1.0606 against the Hong Kong dollar. \par \par \uc2  . \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010821dwcm09ewz\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
