\par\par {\*\bkmkstart toc99}{\*\bkmkend toc99}\b \uc2  China yuan closes outside strong end of trade band. \b0\par\par\uc2 175 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 November 2000\par 04:20\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SHANGHAI, Nov 9 (Reuters) - China's yuan ended outside the firm end of its sliver-thin trading band on Thursday, a touch stronger than the previous close due to continued strong dollar selling by Chinese exporters, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The yuan closed at 8.2768 to the dollar, the third time it has closed outside the band in less than a week. It ended at 8.2769 on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The central People's Bank of China has kept the yuan within its narrow band for more than three years, although it has become less active in the past six months. The yuan has closed outside the long standing band more than a dozen times in April. \par \par \uc2  "The yuan movements today were dominated by market trades. There was no \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  seen," said a dealer. \par \par \uc2  Officials say \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2  intends to make its rigid \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  regime more flexible to cushion against shocks arising from the country's accession to the World Trade Organisation but give no timetable. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010822dwb902cvx\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (china near10 interven*) and (rst=